            "created_at": "2026-10-07T15:47:57.067Z",
            "cooked": "<p>I am available today for one small existing n8n workflow problem that needs a fast, evidence-based fix.</p>\n<p>Good fit: webhook payload or JSON mapping failures; Code / Set node transformation bugs; REST API request/response issues; duplicate events or loop prevention; error handling, retries, timeouts, missing alerts; AI node structured-output or tool-call validation.</p>\n<p>Scope: one existing workflow, one bounded defect, up to two contained changes. I do not rebuild the whole system.</p>\n<p>Price: USD 50 fixed. You pay only after I reproduce the problem and show the agreed acceptance test passing. If the issue is outside the agreed scope or I cannot reproduce it, I stop and there is no charge.</p>\n<p>What I need: a sanitized workflow export or screenshots, one failing input/payload, the expected result, and any relevant error message. No production secrets needed.</p>\n<p>Deliverable today when the issue is bounded: root-cause note, fixed workflow/export or exact changes, before/after evidence, and a short rollback note.</p>\n<p>Timezone: Europe/Warsaw. Written async communication is fine.</p>\n<p>DM me with the failing step and expected output. I will tell you quickly whether it fits the same-day USD 50 scope.</p>\n<p>Michal / NeuroCore</p>",
